      "updated": 1782920789653,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirement\nFunctional\n1) search train     4) notification(ticket booking etc...)\n2) Book ticket    5) Live tracking of train\n3) Payment\n\nNon-functional\n1) scalable (1M user)\n2) Availablity\n3) consistency (ticket must be booked or not booked)\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirement\nFunctional\n1) search train     4) notification(ticket booking etc...)\n2) Book ticket    5) Live tracking of train\n3) Payment\n\nNon-functional\n1) scalable (1M user)\n2) Availablity\n3) consistency (ticket must be booked or not booked)\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
