      "seed": 25636714,
      "version": 714,
      "versionNonce": 4306742,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782922757463,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Redis Central locking\n1) Booking flow:\n-> user pass trainid with passenger details ( no of passengers = no of seats)\n-> select seat based on algo. lets assume got seat 1,2,3,4.\n-> Set status of locked with time expire(5 min) in redis for seat 1,2,3,4 example (set traindId:seatNo locked nx 1000 )\n-> Redirect user to payment gateway \n-> after successful payment change status of seat in redis to Reserved.\n-> send notification to user for successful booking. \n-> Update same status in DB to Reserved.\n  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Redis Central locking\n1) Booking flow:\n-> user pass trainid with passenger details ( no of passengers = no of seats)\n-> select seat based on algo. lets assume got seat 1,2,3,4.\n-> Set status of locked with time expire(5 min) in redis for seat 1,2,3,4 example (set traindId:seatNo locked nx 1000 )\n-> Redirect user to payment gateway \n-> after successful payment change status of seat in redis to Reserved.\n-> send notification to user for successful booking. \n-> Update same status in DB to Reserved.\n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
